{
  "Document": [
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H1",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Optimization Tips"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "To make your application as professional and lightweight as possible, you should apply several optimization techniques."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Frontend Optimization (WASM)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "WASM binaries can be large. Use "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "wasm-opt"
        },
        {
          "Text": " (provided by the "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "binaryen"
        },
        {
          "Text": " package) to shrink the size of your Leptos frontend. This can often reduce the binary size by 20-50%."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Backend Optimization (Rust)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "In your "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "Cargo.toml"
        },
        {
          "Text": ", you can enable Link Time Optimization (LTO) and set the panic strategy to "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "abort"
        },
        {
          "Text": " to reduce the binary size further:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "CodeBlock": {
        "language": "toml",
        "code": "[profile.release]\nlto = true\ncodegen-units = 1\npanic = 'abort'\nstrip = true"
      }
    },
    {
      "UnorderedList": [
        {
          "checked": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Bold": [
                    {
                      "Text": "LTO"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": Allows the compiler to optimize across crate boundaries."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Bold": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Strip"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": Removes debug symbols from the final binary, significantly reducing size."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Heading": {
                "level": "H2",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "Text": "Resource Management"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Bold": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Lazy Loading"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": For very large apps, consider loading certain components only when needed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Bold": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Asset Compression"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": Compress images and SVGs before embedding them in the app."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Bold": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Memory Profiling"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": Use tools like "
                },
                {
                  "InlineCode": "heaptrack"
                },
                {
                  "Text": " or "
                },
                {
                  "InlineCode": "Valgrind"
                },
                {
                  "Text": " on the backend to ensure there are no memory leaks in your Rust code."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}